# UI Component Workflow

## Project structure

```
src/ui/
├── primitives/      ← copy-pasted source from github.com/roninoss/rn-primitives (no styles)
│   ├── checkbox.tsx ← raw headless source, no Unistyles, no className
│   └── index.ts
├── components/      ← styled components: primitive + Unistyles, or adapted rnr source
│   ├── Checkbox/
│   │   └── index.tsx
│   └── index.ts
└── theme/           ← colors, spacing, fonts, breakpoints (read-only reference)
```

---

## STEP 1 — Before writing any code, follow this checklist

### A. Decision tree

**First:** check `src/ui/components/` — if the styled component already exists, use it. Stop here.

**If not found in components**, check `src/ui/primitives/`:
- If the primitive file exists → go to STEP 3, create the styled component in `components/`
- If not → follow the tree below

```
Does the component exist in rn-primitives?
(see list: Headless primitives below)
            │
      ┌─────┴─────┐
     YES           NO
      │             │
COPY SOURCE      It is a plain component
from GitHub      (Button, Badge, Card, Input…)
(see B below)         │
      │          Fetch CURRENT source from
      │          reactnativereusables GitHub:
      │          .../new-york/components/ui/<name>.tsx
      │          Convert NativeWind → Unistyles (STEP 2)
      │          Save directly to src/ui/components/<Name>/index.tsx
      │
Save to src/ui/primitives/<name>.tsx (no styles)
Then go to STEP 3 → create styled component in src/ui/components/
```

**If not found on reactnativereusables either:** build from scratch with plain RN (`Pressable`, `View`, `Text`) directly in `src/ui/components/`.

### B. How to copy a primitive from rn-primitives

1. Fetch `package.json` to get exact dep versions:
   ```
   https://raw.githubusercontent.com/roninoss/rn-primitives/main/packages/<name>/package.json
   ```

2. Fetch the current source:
   ```
   https://raw.githubusercontent.com/roninoss/rn-primitives/main/packages/<name>/src/index.tsx
   ```

3. Save the source as-is to `src/ui/primitives/<name>.tsx`.
   - Do NOT add Unistyles or any styles here
   - Fix import paths if the source imports from other `@rn-primitives/*` packages

4. Install ONLY the shared utilities the copied source actually imports, using the exact versions from the `package.json` fetched in step 1:
   ```bash
   yarn add @rn-primitives/slot@x.x.x
   yarn add @rn-primitives/types@x.x.x
   ```
   Do NOT install `@rn-primitives/<name>` itself — we copied the source instead.

5. Always fetch the **current** source at the time of the request. Do not use memorised or cached code.

### C. Headless primitives — exist in rn-primitives (copy source from GitHub)

```
accordion    alert-dialog   aspect-ratio   avatar      checkbox
collapsible  context-menu   dialog         dropdown-menu  hover-card
label        menubar        navigation-menu  popover    progress
radio-group  select         separator      slider      switch
table        tabs           toast          toggle      toggle-group
toolbar      tooltip
```

### D. Plain components — NOT in rn-primitives (copy from reactnativereusables, adapt)

```
alert   badge   button   card   input   skeleton   text   textarea
```

Raw URL for reactnativereusables:
```
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mrzachnugent/react-native-reusables/main/packages/registry/src/new-york/components/ui/<name>.tsx
```

