## STEP 3 — Create the styled component in src/ui/components/

For components that have a primitive in `src/ui/primitives/`, create the styled wrapper here.

### File placement

| What | Where |
|---|---|
| Headless primitive (from rn-primitives) | `src/ui/primitives/<name>.tsx` |
| Styled component | `src/ui/components/<ComponentName>/index.tsx` |
| Plain component (from rnr, no primitive) | `src/ui/components/<ComponentName>/index.tsx` |
| Barrel export | `src/ui/components/index.ts` |

### Code rules

- Import primitives from `@/ui/primitives/<name>` — never from `@rn-primitives/*` directly inside components
- `StyleSheet.create((theme) => ({...}))` at the BOTTOM of every file
- Always merge style prop: `[styles.root, style]`
- No `StyleSheet` from `react-native`, no inline styles
- Always `React.forwardRef` for components that wrap a primitive
- Always set `displayName`

---

## STEP 4 — When design screens are provided

Study every image in detail before asking. Then ask only about what is genuinely unclear:

- All interactive states: default, pressed, focused, disabled, loading, error, success
- Colors: map to tokens in `src/ui/theme/colors.ts`; ask if a color is not in the theme
- Spacing/dimensions that differ from `src/ui/theme/metrics.ts`
- Typography: match to `src/ui/theme/fonts.ts`
- Corner radius, shadow, border
- Animation behavior
- Dark mode variant

**Do NOT write any code until all states and ambiguities are confirmed by the user.**

Standard clarifying questions (ask when not obvious):
- Loading / skeleton state?
- Size variants (sm / md / lg)?
- Style variants (primary / secondary / destructive / ghost)?
- Appears in a list (performance)?
- Needs `ref` forwarding?

---

## How the user requests a component

The AI must follow STEP 1 → STEP 2 → STEP 3 → STEP 4 in that order every time.

Good prompt examples:

> "Add a Checkbox. Check locally first, then follow the rule."

> "Add a Button with variants: default, destructive, outline, ghost. Here is the design: [image]. Ask me anything unclear before coding."

> "Add a Switch. Fetch current source from rn-primitives GitHub, copy to primitives/, then style in components/."
